//   1. iter/adapters/zip.rs::test_zip_cloned_sideffectful  -> BAIL (SideEffect)
//   2. hash/sip.rs::test_hash_no_bytes_dropped_32          -> DIG (finite conj + teeth)
//   3. char.rs::test_decode_utf16_size_hint                -> BAIL (runtime iterator)
